{"version":1,"content":"<p>黃仁勳這位億萬富豪、前英偉達 CEO，把一家遊戲顯卡小廠商帶到 AI 革命的核心晶片巨頭位置。他此前曾説過一句耐人尋味的話：他隨時都可能被解僱。今年 1 月，黃仁勳在和喬迪・謝爾頓的播客訪談中提到：「治理完善的公司裏，CEO 本來就向董事會匯報，董事會向股東負責。如果 CEO 沒能做好本職工作，不管董事會一共是 12、13 還是 15 名成員，都可以將他解聘。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586272.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:01:40.422008+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:53:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:55:00.034069+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:55:00.034069+00:00","content_hash":"9d1715e388b21c0c06d2b8f129b281ede636472d1b963351fc3f7ea34aa593f2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}